    <string name="tutorial_1_title">Tap Away Arrows</string>
    <string name="tutorial_1_body">Every arrow wants to leave the board. Tap one and it flies off in the direction it points.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_title">Find the Free Path</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_body">An arrow can only leave if nothing stands between its tip and the edge of the board.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_title">Watch Your Hearts</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_body">Tapping a blocked arrow costs a heart. Three wrong taps and the level restarts.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_title">Use Helpful Hints</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_body">Stuck? A hint lights up an arrow that really can move right now.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_5_title">Clear the Board</string>
    <string name="tutorial_5_body">Empty the board to finish the level. Every puzzle has a complete solution.</string>
